IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- LAYER 1: section 2026a, "Healthy fluid milk incentives projects"
-- (7 U.S.C. 2026a; lines 2656-2696 of usc07-ch51.txt, a converter's plain-text rendering, not the official text).
-- Money is a NUMBER of dollars; a share or percentage is a fraction (7 percent is 0.07).
-- JUST TRUE / JUST FALSE / JUST n is what the text says, NOTHING is "not covered" (NOTES.md, Reading a result).
-- "government entity" / "governmental entity" is NOT defined here: the definition in s 2028(a)(1) is for "this subsection" only,
-- so section 2026a asks the kind of entity as a fact (NOTES.md, finding 3).

DECLARE `s 2026a(c) entity` IS ONE OF
    `s 2026a(c) a governmental entity`
    `s 2026a(c) a nonprofit organization`
    `s 2026a(c) any other entity`

§ `s 2026a(a) Definition of fluid milk`

-- "levels consistent with the Food and Drug Administration, State, and local standards" is read as three standards, all required (NOTES.md, fork F-2).
-- src:2658 | In this section the term “fluid milk” means all varieties of pasteurized cow’s milk that—
-- src:2659 | (1) is without flavoring or sweeteners,
-- src:2660 | (2) is consistent with the most recent dietary recommendations,
-- src:2661 | (3) is packaged in liquid form, and
-- src:2662 | (4) contains vitamins A and D at levels consistent with the Food and Drug Administration, State, and local standards for fluid milk.
@ref s 2026a(a) fluid milk (src:2658-2662)
GIVEN `the product is pasteurized cow's milk` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is without flavoring or sweeteners` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is consistent with the most recent dietary recommendations` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is packaged in liquid form` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it contains vitamins A and D at levels consistent with the Food and Drug Administration standards for fluid milk` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it contains vitamins A and D at levels consistent with State standards for fluid milk` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it contains vitamins A and D at levels consistent with local standards for fluid milk` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2026a(a) the product is fluid milk` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the product is pasteurized cow's milk`
            AND `it is without flavoring or sweeteners`
            AND `it is consistent with the most recent dietary recommendations`
            AND `it is packaged in liquid form`
            AND `it contains vitamins A and D at levels consistent with the Food and Drug Administration standards for fluid milk`
            AND `it contains vitamins A and D at levels consistent with State standards for fluid milk`
            AND `it contains vitamins A and D at levels consistent with local standards for fluid milk`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the term fluid milk means all varieties of pasteurized cow's milk that"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

§ `s 2026a(b) Projects`

-- src:2664 | The Secretary of Agriculture shall carry out, under such terms and conditions as the Secretary considers to be appropriate, healthy fluid milk incentive projects to develop and test methods to increase the purchase and consumption of fluid milk by members of households that receive supplemental nutrition assistance program benefits by providing an incentive for the purchase of fluid milk at the point of purchase to members of households purchasing food with supplemental nutrition assistance program benefits.
@ref s 2026a(b) healthy fluid milk incentive projects (src:2664)
GIVEN `the project develops and tests methods to increase the purchase and consumption of fluid milk by members of households that receive benefits` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it provides an incentive for the purchase of fluid milk at the point of purchase` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the incentive goes to members of households purchasing food with benefits` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2026a(b) the project is a healthy fluid milk incentive project the Secretary is to carry out` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the project develops and tests methods to increase the purchase and consumption of fluid milk by members of households that receive benefits`
            AND `it provides an incentive for the purchase of fluid milk at the point of purchase`
            AND `the incentive goes to members of households purchasing food with benefits`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the text describes the projects the Secretary shall carry out; it does not say that a project of another description may not be carried out
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

§ `s 2026a(c) Grants or cooperative agreements`

-- src:2667 | To carry out this section, the Secretary, on a competitive basis, shall enter into cooperative agreements with, or provide grants to, governmental entities or nonprofit organizations for projects that meet the purpose and selection criteria specified in this subsection.
@ref s 2026a(c)(1) cooperative agreements and grants (src:2667)
GIVEN entity IS A `s 2026a(c) entity`
      `chosen on a competitive basis` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the project meets the purpose and selection criteria` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2026a(c)(1) the Secretary shall enter into the agreement with, or provide the grant to, the entity` MEANS
    CONSIDER entity
    WHEN `s 2026a(c) any other entity` THEN
        -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): the text names governmental entities and nonprofit organizations and does not say that no other entity may receive a grant
        NOTHING
    OTHERWISE
        BRANCH
            IF `chosen on a competitive basis` AND `the project meets the purpose and selection criteria` THEN JUST TRUE
            -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "on a competitive basis" and "for projects that meet the purpose and selection criteria"
            OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- src:2669 | To be eligible to enter into a cooperative agreement or receive a grant under this subsection, a government entity or nonprofit organization shall submit to the Secretary an application containing such information as the Secretary may require.
@ref s 2026a(c)(2) application (src:2669)
GIVEN `the entity has submitted an application containing the information the Secretary may require` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2026a(c)(2) the entity has met the application requirement` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the entity has submitted an application containing the information the Secretary may require` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "To be eligible to enter into a cooperative agreement or receive a grant under this subsection, a government entity or nonprofit organization shall submit to the Secretary an application"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

-- src:2671 | Projects proposed in applications shall be evaluated against publicly disseminated criteria that shall incorporate a scientifically based strategy that is designed to improve diet quality and nutritional outcomes through the increased purchase of fluid milk by members of households that participate in the supplemental nutrition assistance program.
@ref s 2026a(c)(3) selection criteria (src:2671)
GIVEN `the criteria are publicly disseminated` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the criteria incorporate a scientifically based strategy designed to improve diet quality and nutritional outcomes through the increased purchase of fluid milk by members of participating households` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2026a(c)(3) the projects are evaluated against the required criteria` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the criteria are publicly disseminated` AND `the criteria incorporate a scientifically based strategy designed to improve diet quality and nutritional outcomes through the increased purchase of fluid milk by members of participating households` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Projects proposed in applications shall be evaluated against publicly disseminated criteria that shall incorporate a scientifically based strategy"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

-- src:2673 | Funds made available to carry out this section shall not be used for any project that limits the use of benefits provided under the Food and Nutrition Act of 2008 [7 U.S.C. 2011 et seq.].
@ref s 2026a(c)(4) use of funds (src:2673)
GIVEN `the project limits the use of benefits provided under the Food and Nutrition Act of 2008` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2026a(c)(4) the funds made available under this section may be used for the project` MEANS
    BRANCH
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "shall not be used for any project that limits the use of benefits"
        IF `the project limits the use of benefits provided under the Food and Nutrition Act of 2008` THEN JUST FALSE
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the text bars a use of the funds and does not itself authorize a project that does not limit benefits
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

§ `s 2026a(d) Evaluation and reporting`

-- src:2678 | The Secretary shall provide for an independent evaluation of projects selected under this section that measures, to the maximum extent practicable, the impact on health and nutrition.
@ref s 2026a(d)(1)(A)(i) independent evaluation (src:2678)
GIVEN `the evaluation is independent` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it measures the impact on health and nutrition to the maximum extent practicable` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2026a(d)(1)(A)(i) the evaluation is the independent evaluation required` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the evaluation is independent` AND `it measures the impact on health and nutrition to the maximum extent practicable` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The Secretary shall provide for an independent evaluation of projects selected under this section that measures, to the maximum extent practicable, the impact on health and nutrition"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

-- src:2680 | The independent evaluation under this subparagraph shall use rigorous methodologies, particularly random assignment or other methods that are capable of producing scientifically valid information regarding which activities are effective.
@ref s 2026a(d)(1)(A)(ii) rigorous methodologies (src:2680)
GIVEN `it uses rigorous methodologies, particularly random assignment or other methods capable of producing scientifically valid information` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2026a(d)(1)(A)(ii) the evaluation meets the requirement of rigorous methodologies` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `it uses rigorous methodologies, particularly random assignment or other methods capable of producing scientifically valid information` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "shall use rigorous methodologies"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

-- src:2682 | The Secretary may use funds not to exceed 7 percent of the funding provided to carry out this section to pay costs associated with evaluating the outcomes of the healthy fluid milk incentive projects.
@ref s 2026a(d)(1)(B) costs of evaluation (src:2682)
GIVEN `the funding provided to carry out this section in dollars` IS A NUMBER
      `the funds used to pay costs of evaluating the outcomes in dollars` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2026a(d)(1)(B) the amount used for evaluation is within the limit` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the funds used to pay costs of evaluating the outcomes in dollars` AT MOST (`the funding provided to carry out this section in dollars` TIMES 0.07) THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "not to exceed 7 percent of the funding provided to carry out this section"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

-- December 31 of 2020 and every second year after it: 2020, 2022, 2024 and so on.
-- src:2684 | Not later than December 31 of 2020, and biennially thereafter, the Secretary shall submit to the Committee on Agriculture of the House of Representatives and the Committee on Agriculture, Nutrition, and Forestry of the Senate a report that includes a description of—
@ref s 2026a(d)(2) reporting dates (src:2684)
GIVEN year IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`s 2026a(d)(2) the date by which the report is due in the year` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF year AT LEAST 2020 AND (((year MINUS 2020) MODULO 2) EQUALS 0) THEN JUST (Date 31 12 year)
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the text names December 31 of 2020 and every second year after it, and no other date
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

@ref s 2026a(d)(2) report submitted in time (src:2684)
GIVEN year IS A NUMBER
      `date the report is submitted` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2026a(d)(2) the report is submitted in time` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 2026a(d)(2) the date by which the report is due in the year` year
    WHEN JUST due THEN
        BRANCH
            IF `date the report is submitted` AT MOST due THEN JUST TRUE
            -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Not later than December 31 of 2020, and biennially thereafter"
            OTHERWISE JUST FALSE
    -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): no report is due in that year
    OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- src:2685 | (A) the status of each healthy fluid milk incentives project, and
-- src:2686 | (B) the results of any completed evaluation that—
-- src:2687 | (i) include, to the maximum extent practicable, the impact of the healthy fluid milk incentive projects on health and nutrition outcomes among households participating in such projects, and
-- src:2688 | (ii) have not been submitted in a previous report under this paragraph.
@ref s 2026a(d)(2)(A)-(B) content of the report (src:2685-2688)
GIVEN `it describes the status of each healthy fluid milk incentives project` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it describes the results of every completed evaluation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it repeats a result already submitted in a previous report` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2026a(d)(2) the report describes the matters required` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `it describes the status of each healthy fluid milk incentives project`
            AND `it describes the results of every completed evaluation`
            AND (NOT `it repeats a result already submitted in a previous report`)
        THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "shall submit ... a report that includes a description of"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

-- src:2690 | In addition to the reporting requirements under paragraph (2), evaluation results shall be shared publicly to promote wide use of successful strategies.
@ref s 2026a(d)(3) public dissemination (src:2690)
GIVEN `the evaluation results are shared publicly` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2026a(d)(3) the evaluation results are shared as required` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the evaluation results are shared publicly` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "evaluation results shall be shared publicly"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

§ `s 2026a(e) Funding`

-- src:2693 | There is authorized to be appropriated $20,000,000 to carry out and evaluate the outcomes of projects under this section, to remain available until expended.
@ref s 2026a(e)(1) authorization of appropriations (src:2693)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 2026a(e)(1) the amount authorized to be appropriated, in dollars` MEANS
    20_000_000

-- src:2695 | Only funds appropriated under paragraph (1) in advance specifically to carry out this section shall be available to carry out this section.
@ref s 2026a(e)(2) appropriations in advance (src:2695)
GIVEN `the funds were appropriated under paragraph (1) in advance specifically to carry out this section` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2026a(e)(2) the funds are available to carry out this section` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the funds were appropriated under paragraph (1) in advance specifically to carry out this section` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Only funds appropriated under paragraph (1) in advance specifically to carry out this section shall be available"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE
